[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11760.95, "timestamp": "03:16:00", "text": "仍然继续参加 Joathon 或类似活动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11765.19, "timestamp": "03:16:05", "text": "捐赠类型的活动，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11768.15, "timestamp": "03:16:08", "text": "嗯，我觉得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11771.269, "timestamp": "03:16:11", "text": "是啊，什么都需要钱。嗯。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11776.309, "timestamp": "03:16:16", "text": "虽然令人遗憾，但事实就是如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11778.87, "timestamp": "03:16:18", "text": "但问题是我不知道自己的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11782.07, "timestamp": "03:16:22", "text": "性格以及我有多固执"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11786.87, "timestamp": "03:16:26", "text": "是。说实话，我并不想问这个问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11789.11, "timestamp": "03:16:29", "text": "像这样的帮助，就像社区一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11793.349, "timestamp": "03:16:33", "text": "资金援助就是这样的。我当时就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11795.429, "timestamp": "03:16:35", "text": "我会担心一些事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11798.389, "timestamp": "03:16:38", "text": "未来我总能想办法应对。但我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11801.67, "timestamp": "03:16:41", "text": "我给自己定了一条规矩。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11804.95, "timestamp": "03:16:44", "text": "我从网上赚到的所有钱，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11807.51, "timestamp": "03:16:47", "text": "虚拟管家，那只会回到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11809.99, "timestamp": "03:16:49", "text": "虚拟直播作为一种进步或其他什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11812.87, "timestamp": "03:16:52", "text": "拥有更好的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11816.07, "timestamp": "03:16:56", "text": "是的，这同样适用于音乐。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11818.55, "timestamp": "03:16:58", "text": "当我真正专注于我的音乐事业时"}]